#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Magac"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Sii koontadan magac macno leh oo la soo bandhigi doono."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Magaca isticmaalaha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Magaca isticmaalaha ee loo adeegsan doono xaqiijinta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Erayga sirta ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Erayga sirta ah ee loo isticmaalo xaqiijinta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Erayga sirta ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Eraygaaga sirta ah ee Enable, haddii loo baahdo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Aaladda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Ka saar calaamadda sanduuqan si aad u joojiso in qalabkan keyd-celin loo sameeyo."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Sharaxaadda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Magaca qalabkan (waxaa loo isticmaali doonaa keydinta habaynta iyo SVN haddii aanu magaca martigeliyaha ku jirin habaynta)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Ciwaanka IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Kani waa Cinwaanka IP-ga ee loo adeegsado in lagula xiriiro qalabka."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "Adeegaha TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Adeegaha TFTP ee ikhtiyaariga ah ee qalabkani uu u koobiyeeyo habayntiisa. Bannaanka u daa si aad u isticmaasho dejinta guud ee Adeegaha TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Furaha Martigeliyaha SSH ee la Kaydiyay"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Isbarbardhig algorithm-ka furaha martigeliyaha iyo faraha hex-ka SHA-1 qalabka adigoo maraya kanaal la aamini karo. Server-ka dhexdiisa, ku beddel waddada hoose faylka furaha martigeliyaha ee guud ee u dhigma oo orod: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Isticmaal ficilka qalabka si aad u nadiifiso ka dib beddelaad furaha oo sharci ah."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Galka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Kani waa qaab-dhismeedka galka qaraabada ah ee loo adeegsado kaydinta dejimaha."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Nooca Jadwalka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Intee jeer ayaa kayd-celin loogu sameeyaa qalabkan. Maalinle leh Ku-celin Kasta oo 10 ah wuxuu sameeyaa kayd-celin 10-kii maalmoodba mar; Bille wuxuu sameeyaa kayd-celin bil-kalander dhab ah."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Dib u socodsii Mar kasta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Jadwallada Maalinlaha ah, dib u socodsii keydinta X maalmoodba mar. Jadwallada Toddobaadlaha ah ee aan lahayn Maalmaha Toddobaadka oo gaar ah, dib u socodsii X toddobaadba mar; marka la doorto Maalmaha Toddobaadka keydintu waxay ku shaqeysaa maalmahaas toddobaad kasta goobtanina ma khuseyso."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Maalmaha Toddobaadka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Jadwalka Toddobaadlaha ah, maalinta/maalmaha toddobaadka ee la rabo in keydinta la socodsiiyo toddobaad kasta. Bannaanka u daa si ay u shaqeyso toddobaadyada Dib u Socodsiinta Kasta beddelkeeda."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Bilaha Sannadka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Jadwalka Bishiiba mar, bisha/bilaha sannadka ee la rabo in keydinta la socodsiiyo."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Maalmaha Bisha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Jadwalka Bishiiba mar, maalinta/maalmaha bisha ee la rabo in keydinta la socodsiiyo (Ugu dambeysa = maalinta ugu dambeysa ee bisha)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Toddobaadyada Bisha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Jadwalka Bishiiba Maalin Go'an, toddobaadka/toddobaadyada bisha ee la rabo in keydinta la socodsiiyo."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Maalmaha Toddobaadka (Bishii)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Jadwalka Bishiiba Maalin Go'an, maalinta/maalmaha shaqada ee lala lammaanaynayo doorashada Toddobaadyada Bisha."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
