msgstr "Nooca Qalabka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the type of device that the router is."
msgstr "Dooro nooca qalabka uu yahay ruutarku."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Ogaansho-Toos ah"

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Connection Type"
msgstr "Nooca Xidhiidhka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Kani waa nooca isku xirka ee loo adeegsado la xiriiridda qalabka."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Authentication Account"
msgstr "Koontada Xaqiijinta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose an account to use to Login to the router"
msgstr "Dooro akoon loo isticmaalo in lagu galo router-ka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Midna"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default timeout"
msgstr "Waqtiga dhammaadka ee caadiga ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to wait in seconds for a response"
msgstr "Waqtiga caadiga ah ee ilbiriqsiyada lagu sugo jawaabta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default sleep time"
msgstr "Waqtiga hurdada ee caadiga ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to sleep in microseconds (1/1,000,000th of a second)"
msgstr "Waqtiga caadiga ah ee la sugo oo ku cabbiran maykro-ilbiriqsi (1/1,000,000 ilbiriqsi)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "U qaado in sare loo qaaday"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Calaamadee sanduuqan si aad u qaadato in qalabkani uu had iyo jeer sarreeyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Magaca nooca qalabkan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Codsiga Magaca Isticmaalaha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Tani waa codsiga magaca isticmaalaha ee la waafajinayo marka la soo galayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Dalabka Erayga sirta ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Tani waa codsiga erayga sirta ah ee la waafajinayo marka la soo galayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Faylka qaabeynta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Kani waa goobta caadiga ah ee faylka dejinta ee ku yaalla qalabka fog. Waxaa loo adeegsadaa hababka SCP iyo SFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Koobiyeey TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Kani waa qoraalka CLI ee loo adeegsado in loogu diro kaydinta adeegaha tftp."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Amarka Qabashada"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Amar ikhtiyaari ah oo wax-soo-saarkiisa loo keydiyo sidii habayn ahaan, halkii loogu koobiyayn lahaa adeegaha TFTP. Mar walba wuxuu ku socdaa SSH, iyadoo aan loo eegin Nooca Xiriirka, qalabkuna markaas uma baahna adeegaha TFTP. Bannaanka u daa aaladaha u koobiyeeya habayntooda TFTP. Tusaale ahaan MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Muuji Nooca"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Kani waa qoraalka CLI ee loo adeegsado in lagu muujiyo nooca hadda jira."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Digniinta Xaqiijinta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Tani waa codsiga xaqiijinta ee la waafajinayo ka hor dirista."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Xaqiiji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Ma jiraa weydiin xaqiijin ah oo ku saabsan koobiyeynta habaynta?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Ku qasab Xaqiijinta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Ma jiraa weydiin xaqiijin qasab ah oo ku saabsan koobiyeynta habaynta?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Hubi Dhammaadka Qaabeynta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Hubi dhammaadka qaabeynta?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Codsi Furaha Kasta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Qoraal u dhigma codsi qaabaysan oo ah 'Riix Fure Kasta Si Aad U Sii Wadato'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Tilmaamaha Gelitaanka Kadib"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Lammaaneyaal su'aal/jawaab ikhtiyaari ah oo la diro isla marka la galo kaddib, ka hor amarka koobiyaynta-TFTP, halkii sadarba mid sida prompt|response. Su'aasha waxaa loo barbardhigaa sidii regular expression aan kala saarin xarfaha waaweyn iyo kuwa yaryar oo ka dhan ah wax-soo-saarka qalabka (markaa iyadu ma koobi karto |, qaansooyinka iyo xarfaha gaarka ahna waa in la baxsiiyo, tusaale Save \\[y/n\\]), jawaabtana waxaa loo diraa sidii loo qoray, ama isticmaal <CR> si aad u dirto soo-celin gaari oo keliya. Jawaabta waxaa la diraa oo keliya marka su'aasheeda la arko, ha noqoto jawaabta jawaabtii hore ama wax-soo-saarka dambe; haddii kale digniin ayaa la diiwaangeliyaa waxna lama diro. Kuwan ayaa marka hore laga jawaabaa; su'aasha Any Key ee kore waxaa laga jawaabaa hadhow, inta qalabka la hawlgelinayo, markaa su'aal halkan looga jawaabay waligeed ma gaarto Any Key. Tusaale: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Guud"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Qaabka Soo-bandhigidda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Ma in Qaabeynta Router-ka lagu soo bandhigo Console-ka mise Tab-ka Sare."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Koonsool"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Tabka Sare"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Xariiqyada Macnaha Farqiga Qaabeynta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Tirada caadiga ah ee xariiqaha aan isbeddelin ee la soo bandhigayo ka hor iyo ka dib isbeddel kasta marka la isbarbar dhigayo laba kayd (backup). Qiimo weyn wuxuu fududeeyaa in la arko macnaha dejinta ku hareeraysan. Tan waa la dhaafi karaa isbarbar dhig kasta bogga Isbarbar-dhigga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Waqtiga xidhiidhka wuu dhammaaday"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee la sugo oo ilbiriqsiyo ah marka la samaynayo isku-xirka shabakadda ee bilowga ah ee lala yeelanayo qalab. Qalab xanniban ama aan la gaari karin waa laga tagaa kaddib waqtigan dhammaadka si kaydinta jadwalsan ay ugu sii socoto aaladaha kale."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Xir adigoon bixin"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Haddii la calaamadeeyo, marka la xirayo isku xirka Qalabka, lama bixin doono amar 'exit' ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Kaydka Xiriirka Cilad-saarka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Haddii la diiwaangelinayo wax-soo-saarka tooska ah ee xiriirka qalabka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "U qaado in dhammaan aaladaha sare loo qaaday"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Haddii loo qaadanayo in dhammaan aaladuhu ay leeyihiin mudnaan sare"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Saacadda Soo dejinta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Saacadda maalinta ee la samaynayo soo dejinta buuxda."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Jadwalka Isku-dayga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Waqtiga la sugayo ka hor inta aan la isku dayin soo dejin dheeraad ah marka soo dejinta jadwalka leh ay fashilanto"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Muddada Kaydinta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Tirada maalmaha lagu haynayo nuqullada kaydka duugga ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Keydi Nuqullada Kaydka ee Qalabka Aan Firfircoonayn"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadeeyo, nadiifinta haynta ma tirtiri doonto nuqullada kaydka ee duugoobay ee ka tirsan aaladaha la joojiyay ama aaladaha laga saaray, si habaynta qalabka la joojiyay ama aan la gaari karin loo hayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Wareejinta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Nooca xiriirka ee caadiga ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Nooca xiriirka ee caadiga ah ee loo adeegsado in lagula xiriiro qalabka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Ku kala saar Qalab ahaan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "U kala saar Qaabaynta la kaydiyay fayl-gal qalabkiiba"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Galka-hoosaadka Taariikhaysan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Geli galka hoose ee ku salaysan taariikhda waddada kaydinta (ka hor galka qalab kasta), si hawlgal kasta loogu kaydiyo taariikhda kaydintiisa, tusaale ahaan .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Haddii uu dansan yahay wuxuu ilaaliyaa qaabka hadda jira."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Jidka SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo SCP, ka tagista meeshan oo bannaani waxay isticmaali doontaa qaybta SCP ee PHP taas oo aan had iyo jeer shaqayn. SCP dibadda ah waa la joojiyay inta xaqiijinta furaha martigeliyaha SSH la hawlgeliyay sababtoo ah dib uma isticmaali karto xiriirka la xaqiijiyay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Xaqiiji Furayaasha Martigeliyaha SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Diiwaangeli furaha martigeliyaha SSH ee qalab kasta marka ugu horreysa ee la xiro oo diid dirista aqoonsiga haddii uu hadhow isbeddelo. Habka SSH/Telnet dib uguma laaban doono Telnet inta xaqiijintu ay hawlgashan tahay. Ka dib isbeddel furaha oo sharci ah, isticmaal tallaabooyinka qalabka si aad u nadiifiso furaha martigeliyaha ee kaydsan."

