#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Ku dar Kala-duwanaanshaha Habaynta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Ku dar farqiga midaysan (unified diff) ee qalab kasta oo qaabayntiisu isbeddeshay intii lagu jiray hawlgalka Iimaylka kaydinta, si dib-u-eeguhu u arko waxa dhabta ah ee isbeddelay. Qaabaynta binary-ga ah (aan qoraal ahayn) waa laga boodaa. Sadarada isbeddela kaydin kasta (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' iyo 'Current configuration :', iyo NX-OS '!Time:' iyo '!Running configuration last done at:') had iyo jeer waa la iska indho-tiraa. Digniin: farqiga waxaa loogu diraa qoraal cad qof kasta oo hela Iimaylka, sidaas darteed wuxuu daaha ka qaadi karaa qaabayn ahayd inay qarsoonaato; ka tag Ku dar Siraha Farqiga (Include Secrets in Diffs) iyadoon la calaamadin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Ku dar Siraha Kala-duwanaanshaha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "U dir qiyamka sirta ah ee ku jira farqiga la iimaylay sida ay yihiin. Marka aan la calaamadayn (tan caadiga ah), sadarrada isbeddelay waxaa laga helaa qaabaynta ceeriin waxaana la daabacaa iyaga oo la qariyay, iyadoo la xirayo haddii khalad dhaco: sadarrada ay ku jiraan erayo sir u eg (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) iyo sadarrada martigeliyaha iyo isticmaalaha SNMP waxaa lagu soo koobaa eraygooda koowaad oo ay ku xigto &lt;secret hidden&gt;, sadar kasta oo ka tirsan baloog PEM ah, shahaado ama baloog xarig-furaha, ama qiimo leh xigasho dhowr-sadar ah, iyo sadar kasta oo hex ama base64 ah, waa la qariyaa; baloog aan waligiis dhammaan wuxuu qariyaa inta ka hartay qaabaynta. Tani waxay sidoo kale qarisaa sadarrada aan dhibka lahayn (tusaale sharraxaad xusaysa fure), laakiin sadar kasta oo isbeddelay weli wuu soo muuqdaa, isagoo lagu calaamadeeyay (changed) marka qaybtiisa qarsoon oo keliya ay kala duwan tahay, baloog aan waligiis dhammaanna waxaa lagu xusaa Iimaylka. Kaydyada la keydiyay weligood lama beddelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Qaababka Ka-reebista Diff"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Weedho joogto ah (regular expressions) oo ikhtiyaari ah (halkii sadarba mid) oo u dhigma sadarrada habaynta ee la iska indho-tirayo marka la isbarbardhigayo, si sadarrada isbeddelaya sida shaabadaha waqtiga ama lambarada taxanaha aysan ugu muuqan isbeddel. Qaab kasta waxaa loo waafajiyaa iyadoo aan la kala saarin xarfaha waaweyn iyo kuwa yaryar meel kasta oo sadarka ka mid ah haddii aan lagu xirin ^ ama $; qaab aan ahayn weedh joogto ah oo sax ah waa la iska indho-tiraa."

